---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SDD_SEQ_07_LD as L and D Manager
  participant SDD_SEQ_07_UI as Baseline UI
  participant SDD_SEQ_07_Service as AdaptiveBlueprintService
  participant SDD_SEQ_07_Auth as Trusted actor/resource ports
  participant SDD_SEQ_07_DB as PostgreSQL
  participant SDD_SEQ_07_Ready as Eligibility/catalog/model<br/>ports
  SDD_SEQ_07_LD->>SDD_SEQ_07_UI: save configuration
  SDD_SEQ_07_UI->>SDD_SEQ_07_Service: working ID + expected revision + key/body
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_Auth: require L and D, tenant, job position and entitlement
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_DB: coordinate scope, compare Draft identity/revision
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_DB: save Draft and immutable command receipt
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_07_UI: saved Draft/revision
  SDD_SEQ_07_LD->>SDD_SEQ_07_UI: preview saved revision
  SDD_SEQ_07_UI->>SDD_SEQ_07_Service: test saved configuration
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_Ready: resolve actual eligible pool
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_07_UI: preview, no assessment writes
  SDD_SEQ_07_LD->>SDD_SEQ_07_UI: confirm activation/replacement
  SDD_SEQ_07_UI->>SDD_SEQ_07_Service: expected Draft + expected current + command key
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_DB: exclusive activation coordination
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_Ready: revalidate pool/catalog/model snapshots
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service->>SDD_SEQ_07_DB: immutable version + activation pointer +<br/>receipt/event
  SDD_SEQ_07_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_07_UI: active version
